  "description": "Adds a green algae layer on waterlogged blocks",
  "body": "# Visually Waterlogged!\n### About\nThis pack adds a green algae layer on waterlogged blocks!\nCan be useful when using top slabs as a floor or something\n\n🚨 1.21.2+ REQUIRED 🚨\n\n### Currently supported blocks:\n- Slabs\n- Stairs\n- Fences\n- Walls\n\n### Notice\nUnfortunately the overlay doesn't work with custom textures\n\nI tried but I couldn't figure it out so every block has to have its own wet texture :/\n\n### Showcase\n![All wet block textures](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FuRfUG4B/images/0500d27b9861c754a5308883e0b4d098239b7f58.png)",
